<title>POLAND: WBK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 13.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 13.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 13.07 vs   12.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.02 vs   18.61</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 42.25 vs   34.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	69.78 vs   60.37</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					134.02 vs   98.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  193.79 vs  162.27</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		362.77 vs  298.89</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     664.38 vs  558.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
